{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13720","headline":"奉酬刘侍郎 · 顾况","name":"奉酬刘侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几回新秋影，壁满蟾又缺。\n镜破似倾台，轮斜同覆辙。\n虽分上林桂，还照沧洲雪。\n暂伴顦顇人，归华耿不灭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13720.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13720","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}